  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Hum.Response 06-09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF Hum.Response 06-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen f&#xf6;r programmet &#xe4;r att bidra till att st&#xe4;rka UNICEF:s humanit&#xe4;ra responskapacitet f&#xf6;r att b&#xe4;ttre kunna bem&#xf6;ta barns behov och r&#xe4;ttigheter i humanit&#xe4;ra kriser, samt tillhandah&#xe5;lla en f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;gbar och effektiv respons till barn i instabila situationer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNICEF programme to strengthen its capacity for humanitarian action and response in order for UNICEF to be better equipped to provide a dependable, timely, effective and consistent humanitarian response to meet the needs of women and children in emergencies, and strengthen the overall efforts of all partners for a coordinated UN humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
